'''Gold Candy''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''1st''' on the [[Christmas Event 2017]] Leaderboard.

==Apperance==
The Gold Candy has the same appearance as [[Candy]], but replacing the red color with a shiny golden coloring.

==Trivia ==
*During the event, players would collect as many [[Snow Tokens|Winter Tokens]] (act exactly like [[coins]] but Christmas-exclusive) and points, which determined their rank on the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this knife include [[Bronze Candy]], [[Silver Candy]], and [[Blue Candy]].
**The trophy reskins were awarded 2 years after the original [[Candy]] was added to the game.
* This item is a gold reskin of [[Candy]], a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife from the [[Christmas Event 2015]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*The sole owner of this weapon was '''[https://www.roblox.com/users/71585705/profile xzLordKillerzx].'''
**However xzLordKillerzx's account was terminated during October 2018 for an unknown reason.
**It’s has been confirmed that xzLordKillerzx came back with his new account called [https://www.roblox.com/users/813910569/profile zLordkk] after the account got terminated.
**The owner of this weapon never claimed his trophy, as he was terminated before the trophy was released, as a result nobody will ever seen this items in game.

